  "scope": "Stage 5a (D29): Berry curvature and Chern numbers of LSWT magnons on the common pipeline, reusing the stored diagonalization.",
  "decisions": {
    "D29": "User decision 2026-09-30 (recommendations adopted): (1) thermal Hall returned as kappa_xy^2D / T in units of k_B^2 / hbar per layer (5b); (2) curvature in the D13 full-position gauge, Chern numbers and kappa gauge invariant (tested); (3) Omega = dA_y/dk_x - dA_x/dk_y with A = i <u| eta grad u>, C = (1/2 pi) int Omega, kappa = -(k_B^2 T / hbar A) sum c2 Omega, sign anchored by the physical Bloch states (ED); (4) the Kitaev [111]-polarized state is the reference model with pairing terms."
  },
  "added": {
    "code-space/spintoolkit/observables/berry.py": "berry_curvature (Kubo, reusing compute_berry_curvature of observables/topology.py), BerryCurvature.chern_numbers (Kubo integral), chern_numbers_fhs (link variables with the paraunitary product, zone-boundary gauge matrix, admissibility check), chern_numbers (accepted only when Kubo and FHS agree), zone_gauge",
